== 5. Every RASSF9 core methylation summary ====================

    value      n  what                                                           where
    0.588     56  Melanoma lines with methylation (median of per-line core score) Tables 5, 6; Summary
    0.572     39  Melanoma lines with methylation AND expression (median)        Table 10 context; Figure 5
    0.183    940  Other lineages with a lineage annotation (median)              Table 6
    0.374    469  TCGA-SKCM, mean of the five core probe medians                 Tables 4, 5

  A further figure, 0.161, appears in Table 5 as the mean of the five
  core PROBE medians in other lineages. It is not the median of per-line
  scores (that is the 0.183 above). Both are correct; they summarise the
  same data in different orders (probe-first vs line-first). The note
  should state which is which wherever either appears.

